<div class="markdown-table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Table, scrollable horizontally" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Value</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Alpha</td><td>1</td></tr><tr><td>Beta</td><td>2</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<h2 id="escaped-pipe-and-pipe-inside-inline-code">Escaped pipe and pipe inside inline code<a class="markdown-heading-anchor" href="#escaped-pipe-and-pipe-inside-inline-code" aria-label="Link to this section"><span aria-hidden="true">#</span></a></h2>
<div class="markdown-table-scroll" role="region" aria-label="Table, scrollable horizontally" tabindex="0"><table><thead><tr><th>Case</th><th>Rendered as</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Escaped pipe</td><td>a | b</td></tr><tr><td>Pipe inside inline code (escaped for the table)</td><td><code>a | b</code></td></tr><tr><td>Pipe escaped inside a link label</td><td><a href="https://github.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">a | b</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
